docs {
  # Download Attachment Stream

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/:id/download`
  **Auth:** Optional (`OptionalAuth` middleware). Public attachments require no auth; private attachments require Bearer token of uploader or group member.

  ## Description

  Streams the raw file bytes directly from RustFS / S3 storage through the backend server as a file download. Sets the `Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="..."`, `Content-Type`, and `Content-Length` headers properly.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Optional | Bearer access token (required for private files) |

  ### URL Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `id` | `int64` | Yes | Attachment ID |
}
